OL,3,GNEWSAFoster homes sought for trainee
OL,4,Aguide dogs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity is seeking foster homes for
OL,7,Fsome of the 27 guide dogs it currently
OL,8,Fhas in training.
OL,10,FThe Guide Dogs Exeter Training Centre
OL,11,Fsaid the number of dogs it currently
OL,12,Fhad in school was the highest in six
OL,13,Fyears.
OL,15,FIt said homes were needed for dogs
OL,16,Freaching about one year old as they
OL,17,Fwent through their formal training,
OL,18,Fwhich would normally be completed
OL,19,Fbefore the animals reached the age of
OL,20,Ftwo.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
