OL,3,GNEWSAFoster homes sought for trainee
OL,4,Aguide dogs
OL,5,
OL,6,FDogs work with trainers during the day
OL,7,Fto learn essential skills, including
OL,8,Fnavigating busy streets and avoiding
OL,9,Fobstacles. But fosterers are needed to
OL,10,Fprovide them with loving homes for
OL,11,Fbetween three and six months, the
OL,12,Fcharity said.
